      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUSH MAYHEM (3) is better than last start when sixth (23.24) from Box 3 at this track over 390m. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from seven starts. Better than last start and worth following up. CRUISING JAMIE (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 3 length fifth (25.71) over 450m at this track. One of the main contenders. LEKTRA DAMIAN (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (17.85) at Mt Gambier in a Grade 5. Can find the frame this time. BUSH JEWEL (4) did a good job to finish third last time out over 390m at Ballarat (22.85) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
